# graphify: only index the Obsidian vault content, nothing else in this repo.
# Note: graphify's matcher uses fnmatch, where `*` also matches `/`, so a
# single trailing `**` behaves like a recursive glob here.

# Ignore everything by default
/*

# Un-ignore the vault directory itself (so the scan descends into it)...
!/llm-knowledge
# ...and everything inside it
!/llm-knowledge/**

# ...except Obsidian's own app/plugin state, which isn't vault content
/llm-knowledge/.obsidian
